ll,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.dev4.official [bd2ca13c6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF (20 threads) - 47.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf autoload is stored by uid instead of path, error will occur: (please ignore the wrong uid on the right, it's from another project)\n\n<img width=\"722\" height=\"434\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41e40bb0-0187-49be-8593-9af1dbff3a30\" />\n\nmain.gd:\n```\nextends Node2D\n\nconst UserManagerClass = preload(\"res://user_manager.gd\")\nconst ItemManagerClass = preload(\"res://item_manager.gd\")\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar _user_manager: UserManagerClass = preload(\"res://user_manager.gd\").new()\n\tvar _item_manager: ItemManagerClass = ItemManager\n```\n\nuser_manager.gd:\n```\nextends RefCounted\n\n```\n\nitem_manager.gd:\n```\nextends Node\n\n```\n\n\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"753\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f5425a5-46c6-40ed-a886-371ba97dff1a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen MRP will see the error.\nModify project.godot, set `ItemManager=\"*res://item_manager.gd\"`, re-open MRP, error disappears.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_script_2025-11-22_23-01-03.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23689801/test_script_2025-11-22_23-01-03.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users